  "description": "Meet Noel, a part-time worker at a pet store who’s completely and utterly obsessed with puppies. Noel loves puppies so much that he decides to join a chat app to find a friend who likes them as much as he does. Just his luck, he manages to find \"J,\" a user that seems to match Noel’s passion for cuddly creatures. After Noel decides to send J a collar as a gift, J suggests they meet in person. When J shows up wearing the collar around his own neck, it’s evident there has been some sort of misunderstanding between the two… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
